WEBVTT

00:08.650 --> 00:10.230
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:10.230 --> 00:13.070
Just staring at your dorky face, sleepy.

00:13.070 --> 00:14.740
You should've <i>seen</i> yourself!

00:15.030 --> 00:17.160
Don't watch if you got a problem with it.

00:17.160 --> 00:20.790
It's like watching pigs 
sleep at zoos, ya know?

00:20.790 --> 00:22.870
You're lucky I don't take you to court.

00:22.870 --> 00:25.750
Why, I'd love to be the judge for that!

00:25.750 --> 00:29.000
That's one <i>hell</i> of a rigged case!

00:33.380 --> 00:34.760
<b>I'm Getting Married</b>

00:34.760 --> 00:36.340
<b>to a Girl I Hate in My Class</b>

00:36.640 --> 00:39.350
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Girl I Hate in My Class</b>

01:42.370 --> 01:43.040
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Girl I Hate in My Class</b>

01:54.250 --> 01:58.970
<b>I'm Getting Married
to a Girl I Hate
in My Class</b>

01:59.090 --> 02:03.010
<b>#12</b>

01:59.090 --> 02:03.010
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Guy
I Hate in My Class</b>

02:01.350 --> 02:03.390
Do you have any plans today?

02:03.390 --> 02:05.680
Maybe read some books. Why?

02:05.680 --> 02:08.020
Then let's watch a movie together!

02:08.280 --> 02:12.360
We can't go out yet, but 
we can hang out at home.

02:12.360 --> 02:14.890
You can pick any movie you want.

02:16.650 --> 02:18.280
I baked some cookies!

02:18.650 --> 02:20.790
We can eat them during the movie!

02:20.790 --> 02:23.280
<i>Why is she so nice today?</i>

02:23.280 --> 02:25.080
<i>Am I about to get murdered?</i>

02:27.160 --> 02:30.540
Hey there!
What are you doing?
Wanna voice chat?

02:29.040 --> 02:30.540
I'm a bit busy right now.

02:30.540 --> 02:32.790
Are you flirting with Himari again?

02:32.790 --> 02:34.880
It's not like I can ignore her.

02:34.880 --> 02:37.800
Whatever. I saw you texting 
each other yesterday, too.

02:37.800 --> 02:38.880
Y-You saw that?!

02:38.880 --> 02:41.220
Yeah! It's like you're actually going out!

02:41.220 --> 02:43.340
Y-You even sent thirst traps to each other!

02:43.340 --> 02:44.710
I didn't send anything!

02:44.710 --> 02:46.640
Well, you got some from Himari!

02:46.640 --> 02:48.260
You didn't happen to save them, did you?

02:48.260 --> 02:49.180
Like I'd <i>ever</i>!

02:49.390 --> 02:50.100
Hmph!

02:50.480 --> 02:53.360
<i>Is she... jealous?</i>

02:56.230 --> 02:57.780
Welcome home.

02:58.570 --> 02:59.860
<i>Oh yeah...</i>

03:00.530 --> 03:04.200
You and I first met in high school, right?

03:04.200 --> 03:06.160
Huh? Y-Yeah...

03:06.490 --> 03:11.290
Then why did you say "Hojo-kun, long time 
no see" at our enrollment ceremony?

03:11.790 --> 03:13.750
What?! I don't know what 
you're talking about!

03:13.750 --> 03:15.130
You clearly misheard me!

03:15.130 --> 03:18.420
Nope, I know what I heard. 
I have a perfect memory.

03:18.420 --> 03:21.680
Th-Then I mistook you for someone else!

03:21.680 --> 03:26.390
I would've never come near you 
if I knew how heartless you are!

03:26.390 --> 03:28.220
H-Hey. What about the movie?

03:30.770 --> 03:33.690
<i>Why is that what you remember?</i>

03:34.610 --> 03:37.780
<i>You forgot the most important part.</i>

03:43.320 --> 03:44.700
How wonderful.

03:45.870 --> 03:47.160
Good to see you.

03:58.670 --> 04:01.720
<i>Isn't this his party?</i>

04:01.720 --> 04:03.800
G-Good evening.

04:03.800 --> 04:06.720
Good evening. You seem tired.

04:06.720 --> 04:11.720
Y-Yes, I'm not used to events like 
this, so I feel a bit out of place.

04:11.720 --> 04:15.100
I came outside to get some fresh air.

04:15.400 --> 04:17.610
But I can leave if I'm bothering yo—

04:17.610 --> 04:18.360
Wait!

04:18.360 --> 04:20.070
Wh-What is it?

04:20.070 --> 04:24.610
Oh, sorry. I'm just tired 
of that crowd, too.

04:24.610 --> 04:28.740
I'm not interested in 
pleasantries and empty words.

04:29.240 --> 04:31.490
Wanna talk a bit if you're free?

04:32.750 --> 04:33.870
Unless...

04:33.870 --> 04:35.250
S-Sure!

04:35.710 --> 04:39.630
Great. I could use some company.

04:41.300 --> 04:42.510
Okay!

05:00.650 --> 05:03.280
Entrance Exam
Venue

05:00.650 --> 05:03.280
Heiandai Academy

05:02.610 --> 05:05.900
<i>And the winter of entrance exams...</i>

05:03.280 --> 05:06.360
English Vocabulary

05:07.570 --> 05:11.830
<i>I solved those problems 
with everything I had.</i>

05:12.880 --> 05:14.870
Entrance Ceremony

05:13.910 --> 05:14.870
<i>Only for you to...</i>

05:18.330 --> 05:21.250
H-Hojo-kun, long time no see.

05:23.010 --> 05:24.090
Who are you?

05:26.010 --> 05:28.260
Saito, you idiot.

05:28.260 --> 05:31.140
I was looking forward to seeing you so much.

05:31.390 --> 05:33.640
But I'm the only one who remembers.

05:34.060 --> 05:37.390
I hate you so much.

05:47.030 --> 05:48.950
Akane, you okay?

05:49.410 --> 05:51.660
You should see a doctor 
if you're not feeling well.

05:52.030 --> 05:56.830
I'm sorry. I feel fine. I'm just a bit...

05:56.830 --> 06:00.130
Did I say something to upset you?

06:00.130 --> 06:01.880
I'll apologize if I did.

06:01.880 --> 06:03.920
No, that's not it.

06:03.920 --> 06:07.760
I promise I'll make supper, so can 
you leave me alone for a bit?

06:08.380 --> 06:10.050
I'll make dinner tonight.

06:11.180 --> 06:13.810
Don't worry, I won't use protein powder.

06:13.810 --> 06:16.560
Go ahead and rest. I'll 
go get some groceries.

06:20.230 --> 06:22.400
Hey, you got some time?

06:22.400 --> 06:24.820
Let's take a drive to the beach.

06:24.820 --> 06:27.490
No thanks. I'm a high schooler, you know.

06:27.490 --> 06:30.660
You're dressed like that as a high schooler?

06:30.660 --> 06:32.870
Let me guess, you like this?

06:32.870 --> 06:33.870
Hey!

06:34.540 --> 06:35.950
Let her go.

06:35.950 --> 06:37.080
Who the hell are you?

06:37.080 --> 06:38.290
Get outta here!

06:38.290 --> 06:39.620
This has nothing to do with you.

06:40.250 --> 06:43.460
It does, though. I'm her boyfriend.

06:44.630 --> 06:47.760
If you don't stop, I'll have 
to gouge your eyes out

06:47.760 --> 06:50.760
and toss them in the ocean. You cool with that?

06:51.340 --> 06:53.140
I'm good either way. You choose.

06:54.180 --> 06:55.560
The hell was that?

06:55.560 --> 06:56.810
What a psycho.

06:56.810 --> 06:58.140
Let's go.

06:58.430 --> 07:00.440
Thanks, Saito-kun.

07:00.440 --> 07:03.440
But that threat seemed a bit over-the-top.

07:03.440 --> 07:04.770
Over-the-top?

07:04.770 --> 07:08.610
I just told them my family's 
usual extermination methods.

07:08.610 --> 07:11.320
Your family's definitely out there!

07:11.610 --> 07:15.120
What were you doing? Waiting for someone?

07:15.120 --> 07:18.500
Nope, just hanging out by myself.

07:18.500 --> 07:21.120
It's getting dark. You should head on home.

07:21.120 --> 07:23.710
You'll run into other guys like that.

07:25.250 --> 07:26.800
I can't go home.

07:27.210 --> 07:28.800
You lose your keys or something?

07:28.800 --> 07:30.970
No, it's just that...

07:30.970 --> 07:34.090
It's tough being home with her around.

07:34.090 --> 07:35.640
Who?

07:35.640 --> 07:38.060
My dad's wife.

07:38.060 --> 07:40.100
Your stepmom, huh?

07:40.100 --> 07:44.360
I usually schedule work 
if I know she'll be home.

07:44.360 --> 07:47.190
But she must have gotten 
the day off last minute.

07:47.190 --> 07:50.190
Well... I see why you're out here then.

07:50.570 --> 07:53.360
It adds up to stay in internet cafés.

07:53.360 --> 07:56.490
Hanging out here saves me some money.

07:56.490 --> 08:00.620
I can relate. I used to go to parks, too.

08:01.080 --> 08:03.170
Yeah, I remember.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.580
What are you up to?

08:05.580 --> 08:08.460
Groceries. We're out of food.

08:08.460 --> 08:12.680
Wow! You're a guy who does house chores?

08:12.680 --> 08:16.260
Male or female, you gotta 
do what needs doing.

08:16.260 --> 08:17.510
Right.

08:17.970 --> 08:20.350
Thanks for helping me out.

08:20.350 --> 08:24.400
I'm okay now. You can go back to Akane.

08:27.020 --> 08:29.530
I'll stay with you for a bit longer.

08:29.530 --> 08:30.690
Why?

08:30.690 --> 08:33.780
No reason. I just want to.

08:39.790 --> 08:44.670
Remember that favor you owe me?
For pretending to be your girlfriend?

08:44.670 --> 08:45.790
Y-Yeah.

08:47.920 --> 08:50.840
I want this to be it.

08:58.220 --> 09:00.260
Hey! Onii-chan!

09:00.260 --> 09:02.930
Onii-chan! Hello?

09:02.930 --> 09:04.020
What is it?

09:04.020 --> 09:07.730
Get it together! Haven't you 
heard me talking to you?

09:07.730 --> 09:11.110
I thought you were teasing me, you perv!

09:11.110 --> 09:13.280
I was just spacing out.

09:13.280 --> 09:15.950
You've been spacey all day.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.410
Did something happen?

09:17.410 --> 09:18.200
Uhh, no.

09:18.200 --> 09:20.910
Hey, something totally <i>did</i> happen!

09:20.910 --> 09:22.910
Let's see. My guess is...

09:22.910 --> 09:24.910
You kissed my sister!

09:24.910 --> 09:25.830
Not her!

09:25.830 --> 09:27.540
Not her, as in, someone else?

09:27.540 --> 09:28.500
Who then?

09:28.500 --> 09:30.460
Don't tell me it was Grandma!

09:30.460 --> 09:31.580
Never!

09:31.580 --> 09:32.380
Then who?

09:32.380 --> 09:34.260
Who did you kiss, Onii-chan?

09:34.260 --> 09:35.420
No one.

09:35.420 --> 09:36.800
You liar!

09:36.800 --> 09:38.800
My detective senses are tickling!

09:38.800 --> 09:40.720
You're definitely gimpy!

09:40.720 --> 09:41.850
You mean guilty!

09:42.100 --> 09:45.060
Brother-kun, you can tell me the truth.

09:46.350 --> 09:48.440
Go on.

09:46.770 --> 09:48.440
What's up, guys?

09:48.440 --> 09:50.230
Himarin! Good timing!

09:50.230 --> 09:53.360
You can help us torture Onii-chan!

09:53.360 --> 09:55.530
That sounds scary.

09:55.530 --> 09:58.860
It's fine. We'll just 
tickle him for 20 hours!

09:58.860 --> 09:59.700
I'd die.

09:59.700 --> 10:03.240
But there's no other way to 
make you spill the beans!

10:03.240 --> 10:05.370
Brother-kun, who did you kiss?

10:05.370 --> 10:08.660
Oh, gotcha! That's what you were asking!

10:09.330 --> 10:11.380
Himarin, you know something?

10:11.380 --> 10:14.620
Umm... Could you give us a sec alone?

10:14.620 --> 10:18.130
You can do it.

10:14.890 --> 10:18.130
Good call! You get him to talk!

10:21.140 --> 10:24.560
I'm sorry, Saito-kun. I got ahead of myself.

10:24.560 --> 10:26.640
It was definitely a shock.

10:26.640 --> 10:31.810
I'd known it wasn't right, but 
I couldn't help myself.

10:33.360 --> 10:36.940
Have you ever kissed someone?

10:36.940 --> 10:37.860
No.

10:37.860 --> 10:42.990
Me neither. I'm happy I got your first kiss.

10:42.990 --> 10:45.410
I didn't mean to give it away.

10:46.160 --> 10:49.790
Wanna do it again?

10:49.790 --> 10:51.290
No thanks.

10:51.290 --> 10:55.630
We did it once already. 
What's a couple more times?

10:55.630 --> 10:57.050
Look...

10:58.340 --> 11:01.090
I love you, Saito-kun.

11:04.100 --> 11:05.810
Is this legit?

11:05.810 --> 11:07.640
Get it, Himari!

11:07.640 --> 11:09.440
What about Himari?

11:09.440 --> 11:10.520
You haven't seen?

11:10.520 --> 11:12.440
It's going around the class group chat!

11:14.940 --> 11:16.650
They look so cute!

11:16.650 --> 11:17.940
It's a good pic!

11:17.940 --> 11:19.190
Did Himari make the first move?

11:19.190 --> 11:20.450
Akane?

11:25.200 --> 11:27.370
Still can't take a hint?

11:27.370 --> 11:29.330
I'll take him for real.

11:44.050 --> 11:46.850
Akane-chan!

11:47.180 --> 11:51.060
You'll get bullied again if 
you keep hanging around me.

11:51.060 --> 11:52.440
Why?

11:52.440 --> 11:54.980
Because everyone hates me.

11:54.980 --> 11:59.110
That must mean only I get 
to see your good side!

11:59.110 --> 12:00.360
That makes me happy.

12:00.820 --> 12:03.530
I really like you a lot, Akane-chan!

12:04.620 --> 12:07.660
What about you? Do you like me?

12:08.240 --> 12:09.200
Yeah.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.790
Yup, that's what I thought!

12:10.790 --> 12:12.250
I love you!

12:12.580 --> 12:15.920
Let's stay best friends forever, Akane!

12:15.920 --> 12:20.420
Yeah. As long as I have you, 
I don't care who hates me.

12:20.420 --> 12:22.010
I won't even get married!

12:22.010 --> 12:25.550
What? I wanna get married one day!

12:25.550 --> 12:30.560
By high school, I'll get myself 
a cool, smart boyfriend!

12:30.560 --> 12:31.640
Traitor!

12:31.640 --> 12:35.480
I'm no traitor! Best friends 
and boyfriends are different!

12:35.480 --> 12:37.520
What's that supposed to mean?

12:39.780 --> 12:40.690
What's wrong?

12:41.240 --> 12:42.530
Nothing.

12:44.150 --> 12:44.990
Here.

12:45.530 --> 12:46.530
What is it?

12:46.910 --> 12:49.030
It's, um, for you.

12:49.580 --> 12:52.200
Since you seemed kinda down.

12:52.200 --> 12:55.040
Thought it might make you feel better.

13:03.300 --> 13:05.720
Wh-What's wrong? Do you hate it?

13:05.720 --> 13:08.390
I thought you'd like it since 
it has strawberries.

13:08.390 --> 13:12.730
I don't hate it at all. I love it.

13:12.730 --> 13:14.440
Then why are you...

13:15.060 --> 13:16.810
I'm just happy!

13:17.440 --> 13:19.690
O-Okay.

13:30.530 --> 13:33.000
<i>I have to do something.</i>

13:39.380 --> 13:40.590
<i>Akane?</i>

13:40.590 --> 13:42.500
Do you have some time?

13:44.050 --> 13:44.800
<i>Sure.</i>

13:48.140 --> 13:52.470
We used to play in this park 
all the time in grade school!

13:52.470 --> 13:54.390
Time sure flies!

13:54.390 --> 13:58.730
Remember when I snuck out 
of the house with a magazine?

13:58.730 --> 14:01.400
I dropped it in a puddle 
and it got all muddy.

14:01.400 --> 14:05.110
So we tried to wash the mud off 
and ruined the whole thing!

14:05.110 --> 14:07.780
That was crazy!

14:07.780 --> 14:10.240
Listen, Himari. I wanted to—

14:10.490 --> 14:11.740
I know.

14:12.790 --> 14:15.750
We're not here to play 
around like old times.

14:17.960 --> 14:21.000
I want you to break up with Saito.

14:21.290 --> 14:23.880
I'm not going out with Saito-kun.

14:23.880 --> 14:27.890
I meant to stop pretending 
to be his girlfriend.

14:27.890 --> 14:32.220
So you're tossing me to the side 
now that your problem's solved?

14:32.220 --> 14:33.140
That's messed up.

14:34.430 --> 14:39.980
But it's weird! It was just supposed 
to be acting, but you're all over him!

14:39.980 --> 14:43.140
You go out on dates after school 
and you even... k-kissed him!

14:43.360 --> 14:47.530
I heard someone took a 
picture. You saw it, too?

14:47.530 --> 14:50.280
A-At this point, it's hardly acting!

14:50.280 --> 14:53.530
It's like you're dating! It's gone too far!

14:53.530 --> 14:56.660
Who cares? It's none of your business.

14:56.660 --> 14:58.410
I-It <i>is</i> my business!

14:58.660 --> 15:03.040
How? You and Saito-kun are only 
married for formalities, right?

15:04.040 --> 15:05.000
But...

15:05.000 --> 15:09.510
But what? I won't stop until 
you give me an actual reason.

15:09.510 --> 15:14.050
I'll go on dates with him, kiss him. 
I'll go even further than that!

15:15.140 --> 15:19.050
I-It's... It's because...

15:19.100 --> 15:21.850
I...

15:22.270 --> 15:28.070
I love Saito!

15:32.530 --> 15:34.580
And? So what?

15:34.580 --> 15:37.750
Huh? Wh-What do you mean?

15:37.750 --> 15:40.960
You've fought with him constantly.

15:40.960 --> 15:43.830
You said you hated him.

15:44.250 --> 15:46.590
Well, yeah, but...

15:46.820 --> 15:52.800
I haven't done that. I've liked 
Saito-kun since our first year of high school.

15:52.800 --> 15:56.600
I've always seen him that 
way, right next to you.

15:57.510 --> 15:59.390
Who are you to barge in now?

15:59.390 --> 16:01.100
Stay out of my way!

16:01.100 --> 16:02.850
You're the one standing in my way!

16:02.850 --> 16:05.230
I've always liked him, too!

16:05.230 --> 16:08.190
I met Saito at a party when we were twelve!

16:08.190 --> 16:11.110
I've been looking forward to 
going to high school with him!

16:11.110 --> 16:15.160
What? You never told me that.

16:15.160 --> 16:18.950
My grandma took me to the 
Hojo family's party one time.

16:18.950 --> 16:22.620
Since she was old friends 
with Saito's grandfather.

16:23.920 --> 16:27.620
Really... It's not fair, Akane.

16:27.840 --> 16:29.340
Fair?

16:29.340 --> 16:32.260
You got to meet Saito-kun sooner 
thanks to your grandma!

16:32.260 --> 16:34.760
Then you even get to <i>marry</i> him 
because they told you to?

16:34.760 --> 16:35.890
It's not fair!

16:35.890 --> 16:41.310
You're just a loner who can't even talk 
to Saito-kun without people helping you!

16:42.390 --> 16:45.800
Well, you're just a creepy people-pleaser!

16:45.800 --> 16:49.900
Creepy? At least I can put 
on a smile, unlike you!

16:49.900 --> 16:53.110
I'd rather bite my own tongue and 
die before I fake-smile for others!

16:53.110 --> 16:57.450
You think Saito doesn't see through 
that empty smile of yours?

16:57.450 --> 17:01.330
I-I doubt it! Besides, it's not empty!

17:01.330 --> 17:03.200
I can fake-smile perfectly fine!

17:03.200 --> 17:05.920
Either way, you're the one that's unfair!

17:05.920 --> 17:08.000
Helping him with 
the fake girlfriend plan...

17:08.000 --> 17:11.920
It was all just an excuse to seduce Saito!

17:11.920 --> 17:13.220
Of course it was.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.970
You're <i>proud</i> of that?

17:14.970 --> 17:16.590
It's your fault for not noticing.

17:16.930 --> 17:20.720
No wonder why your husband 
gets stolen by your friend.

17:22.730 --> 17:24.270
You're so dumb!

17:24.270 --> 17:27.190
Why did you have to pick him of all people?

17:27.190 --> 17:30.480
You could have any guy in the world!

17:30.480 --> 17:32.320
I could say the same to <i>you</i>!

17:32.320 --> 17:34.950
Don't take away the only 
thing I want, you idiot!

17:34.950 --> 17:36.030
Who are you calling idiot?

17:36.030 --> 17:37.450
Well, you are one!

17:37.450 --> 17:39.780
I have good grades, unlike you!

17:39.780 --> 17:42.120
You're an idiot who's only good at studying!

17:46.750 --> 17:50.250
I actually realized a long time ago...

17:50.250 --> 17:54.880
That you liked Saito-kun.

17:55.220 --> 17:57.340
Huh? Wh-When?

17:57.800 --> 17:59.970
Since the first year of high school.

18:00.640 --> 18:05.230
You never went up to guys 
like you did with Saito-kun.

18:05.230 --> 18:09.270
And you always seemed down 
whenever he wasn't in class.

18:09.270 --> 18:12.150
W-Was it that obvious?

18:12.150 --> 18:15.650
Just like I won over everyone in class,

18:16.490 --> 18:20.990
I thought about getting Saito-kun to 
fall for me without anyone noticing.

18:21.950 --> 18:26.790
I can tell what kind of 
holes he has in his heart.

18:26.790 --> 18:30.670
I know how to sneak in,
and I know everything he wants to hear.

18:30.670 --> 18:33.340
Then why didn't you do it?

18:33.340 --> 18:36.590
Because I thought that was insincere.

18:36.970 --> 18:38.880
Towards Saito?

18:38.880 --> 18:42.680
Him too, but more towards you.

18:43.180 --> 18:50.810
If I took him for myself before you 
noticed, you'd regret it your whole life.

18:51.480 --> 18:57.030
You'd never forgive me. You 
wouldn't come to our wedding.

18:57.030 --> 19:00.070
It would be the end of our friendship.

19:01.070 --> 19:04.410
I couldn't... bear that...

19:04.910 --> 19:07.790
It was all for me?

19:07.790 --> 19:11.210
You acted like his girlfriend 
and kissed him,

19:11.210 --> 19:14.840
all to help me realize that I liked him?

19:15.170 --> 19:18.760
No, I'm not all that great.

19:18.760 --> 19:24.010
I figured you'd finally notice, 
but I was definitely up for it.

19:24.760 --> 19:27.890
I'd been waiting so long 
that if there ever was a chance,

19:27.890 --> 19:30.480
I would have taken Saito-kun.

19:32.400 --> 19:35.770
I'm sorry I made you wait 
for two whole years.

19:36.190 --> 19:41.370
You wouldn't have had to if 
we weren't best friends.

19:42.990 --> 19:48.250
Sucks when you're such good friends 
that you fall for the same person.

19:48.250 --> 19:49.370
Yeah.

19:49.620 --> 19:55.210
I don't want to give up you or Saito-kun.

19:55.210 --> 19:56.800
Me neither.

19:56.800 --> 19:59.130
I don't want to lose my best friend.

19:59.130 --> 20:02.260
But I can't hand over Saito.

20:03.430 --> 20:04.720
So, now what?

20:04.720 --> 20:06.350
I'm tough to beat.

20:06.850 --> 20:08.180
I'll do my best.

20:08.560 --> 20:10.520
So that I can catch up to you.

20:10.520 --> 20:13.270
And so that Saito will fall for me.

20:14.190 --> 20:16.980
Then I won't hold back anymore.

20:17.400 --> 20:21.150
Don't you dare go easy on 
me. Or I won't forgive you!

20:28.290 --> 20:29.780
Wh-What's wrong?

20:30.200 --> 20:32.250
Don't barge in like that!

20:32.250 --> 20:34.160
This is <i>my</i> room!

20:34.160 --> 20:36.000
This is a shared space!

20:36.000 --> 20:37.670
Why are you acting so surprised?

20:37.670 --> 20:40.300
Wh-Who said I was surprised?

20:41.010 --> 20:43.260
That's definitely what it looked like.

20:43.260 --> 20:45.090
Whatever. Good morning.

20:45.090 --> 20:46.180
G-Good... morn—

20:46.180 --> 20:48.680
Like I'd say that to you!

20:49.940 --> 20:51.180
Wh-What are you doing?

20:51.180 --> 20:53.940
I was just checking your temperature.

20:53.940 --> 20:55.310
You do feel hot.

20:55.310 --> 20:58.070
That's 'cause you touched me!

21:00.820 --> 21:03.110
She's more combative than usual.

21:03.110 --> 21:06.200
Did I do something to upset her again?

21:06.200 --> 21:09.580
She's mad cause you smooched Himarin!

21:09.580 --> 21:11.200
I'm mad too, you know!

21:11.200 --> 21:12.960
Gimme a kiss!

21:12.960 --> 21:16.330
Mwah mwah mwah!

21:13.330 --> 21:16.330
Brother-kun's first kiss wasn't with Himari.

21:16.330 --> 21:19.170
Huh? What's that mean?

21:19.170 --> 21:20.210
Nothing.

21:20.210 --> 21:22.380
Excuse me, I'd really like an explanation.

21:20.210 --> 21:23.380
Mwah! Mwah! Onii-chan, 
are you listening to me?

21:22.380 --> 21:24.340
Can you elaborate on that?

21:24.340 --> 21:26.890
Yeah, I wanna know too!

21:26.890 --> 21:27.850
Let's hear it!

21:28.180 --> 21:30.000
Shii-chan.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.910
Shisei-chan.

21:31.910 --> 21:33.980
Spit it out, Shise.

21:34.220 --> 21:35.520
Okay.

21:36.230 --> 21:40.350
Then I'll explain from the start: 
the origin of the human race.

21:40.350 --> 21:42.240
That'll take forever!

21:44.740 --> 21:48.100
I don't think Akane's mad, necessarily.

21:48.100 --> 21:50.580
If not, then what's going on?

21:50.580 --> 21:52.680
Never mind that!

21:52.680 --> 21:54.560
Wanna go on a date after school today?

21:54.560 --> 21:57.420
I think we should do more than just kiss.

21:57.420 --> 21:59.830
Like a real boyfriend and girlfriend!

21:59.830 --> 22:02.130
Not fair, Himarin!

22:02.400 --> 22:05.840
Himari!

22:05.840 --> 22:08.330
Oh, hey, Akane. What's up?

22:08.330 --> 22:10.650
We need to talk. Come here!

22:10.650 --> 22:12.730
Hmm, maybe later!

22:12.730 --> 22:15.600
I'm busy seducing Saito-kun right now.

22:15.600 --> 22:19.730
Stop seducing people in broad 
daylight at school! Gross!

22:20.110 --> 22:22.210
Then I'll seduce you at night.

22:23.230 --> 22:28.080
That's even more gross! Get 
off each other right now!

22:26.150 --> 22:29.740
Oh noooo, Saito-kun!

22:30.040 --> 22:32.540
Did something happen between you two?

22:33.060 --> 22:34.250
Why?

22:34.250 --> 22:36.890
Nothing, it's just...

22:36.890 --> 22:40.490
You guys aren't holding 
back like you used to.

22:40.490 --> 22:41.910
Nothing happened.

22:41.910 --> 22:44.250
You had nothing to do with it.

22:44.550 --> 22:46.260
Wait, did I?

22:46.260 --> 22:48.140
If I did, then I'll apologize.

22:48.140 --> 22:50.020
Don't come any closer!

22:50.020 --> 22:53.340
If you do, I'll bite your 
tongue off and kill you!

22:53.340 --> 22:55.760
Bite <i>mine</i> off? What did I do?

22:55.760 --> 22:58.990
A-A bunch of things. Too many to count.

22:58.990 --> 23:02.450
It's all... It's all your fault!

23:02.450 --> 23:05.780
Tell me, then. Otherwise I can't fix it.

23:05.780 --> 23:08.390
T-Tell you?

23:09.560 --> 23:11.510
Wh-What?

23:11.510 --> 23:13.020
I-I thought—

23:13.020 --> 23:14.910
I'll never tell you!

23:14.910 --> 23:18.170
'Cause I hate you!

23:18.170 --> 23:21.410
Well, I knew that much...

23:22.890 --> 23:24.290
Oh boy.

23:27.260 --> 23:33.270
It's true... I hate you so much!
